<title>NETHERLANDS: ABN AMRO's LaSalle Q4 net income up 15 pct.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO's LaSalle Q4 net income up 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth quarter 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of dollars unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net income				  49.4  vs  43.1</p>
<p>    Net income available to common	42.1  vs  35.6</p>
<p>    Net interest income		    146.6  vs 129.9</p>
<p>    Non interest income		     74.6  vs  64.4</p>
<p>    Non interest expenses		  128.9  vs 113.6</p>
<p>    Loss provision			    22.1  vs  20.3</p>
<p>    Net chargeoffs			    10.0  vs  10.9</p>
<p>NOTE - LaSalle National Corp is a fully owned U.S. unit of Dutch ABN AMRO Bank NV  </p>
<p>Full year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of dollars unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net income				 197.2  vs 174.7</p>
<p>    Net income available to common     168.2  vs 144.4</p>
<p>    Net interest income		    559.3  vs 496.5</p>
<p>    Non interest income		    283.2  vs 246.8</p>
<p>    Non interest expenses		  487.3  vs 430.5</p>
<p>    Loss provision			    69.8  vs  60.9</p>
<p>    Net chargeoffs			    36.6  vs  26.5</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
